  "releaseNotes": "Playmos.Sdk 0.1.1-preview (testnet only — Base Sepolia).\n\n- IAP: PayAsync (server-settle, pk_test_) + VerifyAsync\n- Agents: CreateAgentWalletAsync / FundAgentAsync (sk_test_)\n- Transfers: TransferAsync / GetTransferAsync\n- Prize read: GetPrizeAsync; withdraw is player-signed via @playmos/sdk\n- Automatic HTTP 429 retry (#50 parity with JS)\n- netstandard2.1 · plain HttpClient · no Nethereum\n\nInstall: dotnet add package Playmos.Sdk --version 0.1.1-preview\nDocs: https://playmos.io/docs · https://github.com/playmos-labs/playmos-sdk",
